      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## Start Here\n1. **HTTP 5xx Rate** + **API P95 Latency** are primary health indicators.\n2. **Auth P95 Latency** is expected to be higher because password hashing is CPU-expensive.\n3. **Dependency Error Rate** and **Dependency P95 Latency** reflect DB/Redis health.\n4. **Active Alerts (without Watchdog)** must stay at `0` in normal conditions.\n5. Click top links for deep dive dashboards.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "How To Read",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
